{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight Hordes of monsters coming in waves in Survivor TD, a tower-defense mixed with a roguelite gameplay. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/Combat.gif?t=1749982632\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build towers and walls to manipulate ennemy behavior and become an invincible architect. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/Construction.gif?t=1749982632\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features !</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy thousands of ennemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own maze and battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start new runs with empowered abilities through the shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from different perks to create varied builds</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811540?t=1749982632","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811540?t=1749982632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/dfa9953cc80ecf0c46eef5191b0eb456d3c33e46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749982632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/dfa9953cc80ecf0c46eef5191b0eb456d3c33e46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749982632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3814820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"